SHIONTHEBRUISER-SHION_ENERGY_BALL.descri:
Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.
[gold]Galvanised 1:[/gold] Deals {ExtraDamage:diff()} additional damage, then gain {VigorRefundPercent:diff()}% of the [gold]Vigor[/gold] consumed next turn.{InCombat:
(Gain {VigorRefund:diff()} [gold]Vigor[/gold] next turn)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SHION_BLOOD_RONDO.descri:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage, plus an additional hit for each [gold]Strength[/gold] you have.{InCombat:
(Hits {HitAmount:diff()} {HitAmount:plural:time|times})|}
[gold]Berserk:[/gold] [gold]Patch Up[/gold] for {BerserkLifeSteal:diff()}% of the damage dealt.

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_WALL_OF_TEXT.descri:
Add a copy of ALL cards in your [gold]Hand[/gold] into your [gold]Draw Pile[/gold].
Gain [gold]Block[/gold] equal to double the number of cards created this way.{InCombat:
(Gain {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold])|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_QUICK_MEAL.descript:
[gold]Transform[/gold] ALL cards in your [gold]Hand[/gold] (except [gold]Slimed[/gold]) into [gold]Slimed[/gold].
Heal {Heal:diff()} HP for each card [gold]Transformed[/gold] this way.{InCombat:
(Heal {HealAmount:diff()} HP)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_TURN_THE_TABLES.des:
Apply {WeakPower:diff()} [gold]Weak[/gold]. If you are [gold]Weak[/gold], apply it again.
Gain {VigorPower:diff()} [gold]Vigor[/gold] for each [gold]Weak[/gold] on the enemy.{InCombat:{HasTarget:cond:>0?
(Gain {VigorAmount:diff()} [gold]Vigor[/gold])|}|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_WAIT_A_SECOND.descr:
Gain {WeakPower:diff()} [gold]Weak[/gold] and {IfUpgraded:show:X+1|X} [gold]Memory[/gold] this turn.{InCombat:
(Gain {MemoryAmount:diff()} [gold]Memory[/gold])|}
[gold]Retain[/gold] your [gold]Hand[/gold] this turn.

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_CARTOON_STRIKE.desc:
Deal damage equal to {IfUpgraded:show:twice |}your [gold]Random[/gold].{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}
Apply [gold]Weak[/gold] equal to your [gold]Random[/gold].

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_BOLD_ANNOUNCEMENT.d:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage and apply {Confusion:diff()} [gold]Confusion[/gold] to ALL enemies.
Gain {MemoryThisTurn:diff()} [gold]Memory[/gold] this turn for each enemy.{InCombat:
(Gain {MemoryAmount:diff()} [gold]Memory[/gold])|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_CARTOONY_DODGE.desc:
Gain [gold]Block[/gold] and [gold]Random[/gold] equal to the number of cards played this turn.{InCombat:
(Gain {CardsPlayed:diff()})|}
[gold]Memory[/gold] doesn't play cards this turn.

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_DESCRIPTION.descrip:
Add [gold]{IfUpgraded:show:Fresh Idea+|Fresh Idea}[/gold] into your [gold]Hand[/gold] equal to your [gold]Random[/gold].{InCombat:
(Add {FreshIdeaAmount:diff()})|}
Add [gold]{IfUpgraded:show:Conclusion+|Conclusion}[/gold] and [blue]3[/blue] random{IfUpgraded:show: upgraded|} [gold]Goofball Token Powers[/gold] into your [gold]Draw Pile[/gold].

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_AVATAR_CHARACTER.de:
Deal damage and apply [gold]Confusion[/gold] equal to the number of Powers you played this combat.{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}
Add a copy of each of those Powers into your [gold]Discard Pile[/gold].

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_CHANGE_OF_PLAN.desc:
Discard your [gold]Hand[/gold].
Add a random{IfUpgraded:show: upgraded|} card into your [gold]Hand[/gold] for each card discarded.{InCombat:
(Add {CardsAmount:diff()} {CardsAmount:plural:card|cards})|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_BREAK_CONTINUITY.de:
Put ALL [gold]Fresh Ideas[/gold] from your [gold]Exhaust Pile[/gold] into your [gold]Discard Pile[/gold].
ALL enemies lose that much HP.{InCombat:
(Lose {HpLossAmount:diff()} HP)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_REFUGE_IN_AUDACITY.d:
Gain {BadFaith:diff()} [gold]Bad Faith[/gold].
Lose half of your [gold]Damage Debt[/gold].{InCombat:
(Lose {DebtLossAmount:diff()} [gold]Damage Debt[/gold])|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_RUIN_WALK.descriptio:
[gold]Cooldown[/gold] {Cooldown}.
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.{CooldownLeft:cond:>0?
[gold]On cooldown[/gold] for {CooldownLeft} more {CooldownLeft:plural:turn|turns}.|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_BARE_HANDED_BLADE_BL:
Gain [gold]Block[/gold] equal to your HP.{InCombat:
(Gain {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold])|}
[gold]Block[/gold] is not removed at the start of your next turn.

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_YOU_NUKE_EM.descript:
[gold]Cooldown[/gold] {Cooldown}.
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.{CooldownLeft:cond:>0?
[gold]On cooldown[/gold] for {CooldownLeft} more {CooldownLeft:plural:turn|turns}.|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_RETCON.description:
[gold]Cooldown[/gold] {Cooldown}.
Remove ALL your [gold]Damage Debt[/gold].{CooldownLeft:cond:>0?
[gold]On cooldown[/gold] for {CooldownLeft} more {CooldownLeft:plural:turn|turns}.|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_IMPLAUSIBLE_DENIABIL:
Lose half of your [gold]Damage Debt[/gold].
Take damage equal to your [gold]Damage Debt[/gold].{InCombat:
(Take {DamageAmount:diff()} damage)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_TODO6.description:
Remove the enemy's [gold]Block[/gold].
Lose [gold]Damage Debt[/gold] equal to the amount of [gold]Block[/gold] removed.{InCombat:{HasTarget:cond:>0?
(Lose {DebtLossAmount:diff()} [gold]Damage Debt[/gold])|}|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_HEAL_THYSELF.descrip:
Heal {Heal:diff()} HP for each card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:
(Heal {HealAmount:diff()} HP)|}
Discard your [gold]Hand[/gold].

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_LAST_CHANCE_HIT_POIN:
Until your next turn, gain [gold]Hardened Shell[/gold] equal to your HP minus [blue]1[/blue].{InCombat:
(Gain {ShellAmount:diff()} [gold]Hardened Shell[/gold])|}
[gold]Refuse[/gold] {Refuse:diff()}.

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_DESPERATION_ATTACK.d:
Deal damage equal to your [gold]Damage Debt[/gold].
Triple if your [gold]Damage Debt[/gold] is larger than or equal to your HP.{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_REMOVING_THE_EARPIEC:
Gain {StrengthPower:diff()} [gold]Strength[/gold] per [gold]Requested[/gold] counter.{InCombat:
(Gain {StrengthAmount:diff()} [gold]Strength[/gold])|}
Remove ALL your [gold]Requested[/gold] counters.

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_DOOR_SLAM_OF_RAGE.de:
Gain [blue]1[/blue] [gold]Vigor[/gold] for each Attack in your [gold]Discard Pile[/gold].{InCombat:
(Gain {VigorAmount:diff()} [gold]Vigor[/gold])|}
Add {IfUpgraded:show:[gold]The Door Slams You+[/gold]|[gold]The Door Slams You[/gold]} into your [gold]Hand[/gold].

SHIONTHEBRUISER-FRY_THE_DOOR_SLAMS_YOU.d:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Deal additional damage equal to your [gold]Vigor[/gold].{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SEELS_POTENTIALLY_MASSIV:
Deal {PerEnergy:diff()} damage times the energy cost of this card.
Double this damage if its cost is [blue]2[/blue] or more.{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SEELS_PAYBACK_TIME.descr:
[gold]Blood Bend[/gold] X.
Deal damage equal to the missing HP of ALL {IfUpgraded:show:|other }players X times.{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage X times)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SEELS_PARRY_ATTEMPT.desc:
Gain {Block:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold] times the energy cost of this card.
Double this [gold]Block[/gold] if its cost is [blue]2[/blue] or more.{InCombat:
(Gain {BlockAmount:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold])|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SEELS_SHED_THE_PAIN.desc:
[gold]Exhaust[/gold] ALL your enchanted [gold]Wounds[/gold].
Heal {Heal:diff()} HP per card [gold]Exhausted[/gold] this way.{InCombat:
(Heal {HealAmount:diff()} HP)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SEELS_BLOOD_MIXING.descr:
Lose {HpLoss:diff()} HP for each enemy.{InCombat:
(Lose {HpLossAmount:diff()} HP)|}
ALL enemies lose {HpLoss:diff()} HP and {StrengthPower:diff()} [gold]Strength[/gold].

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SEELS_ILLUSION_OF_RISK.d:
Double your [gold]Vulnerable[/gold].{InCombat:
(Gain {VulnerableAmount:diff()} [gold]Vulnerable[/gold])|}
For the next {IllusionOfRisk:diff()} turns, if you are [gold]Vulnerable[/gold], you take [blue]75%[/blue] reduced damage from [gold]Vulnerable[/gold] enemies.

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SEELS_HUMILIATE.descript:
Apply {VulnerablePower:diff()} [gold]Vulnerable[/gold].
This turn, the enemy loses [gold]Strength[/gold] equal to their [gold]Vulnerable[/gold].{InCombat:{HasTarget:cond:>0?
(Enemy loses {StrengthLossAmount:diff()} [gold]Strength[/gold])|}|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SEELS_QUESTIONABLE_STRAT:
Gain {VulnerablePower:diff()} [gold]Vulnerable[/gold].
Gain [gold]Block[/gold] equal to your [gold]Vulnerable[/gold]{IfUpgraded:show: twice|}.{InCombat:
(Gain {BlockAmount:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold])|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_BICYCLE_TIME.descri:
Discard your [gold]Hand[/gold].
Another player gains X {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)} and {IfUpgraded:show:draws cards until their [gold]Hand[/gold] is full.|draws as many cards as you discarded.}{InCombat:
(They gain {EnergyAmount:energyIcons()}{IfUpgraded:show:|, and draw {DrawAmount:diff()} {DrawAmount:plural:card|cards}})|}
